WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.310
[BEEPING]

00:00:02.310 --> 00:00:04.754
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:00:04.754 --> 00:00:06.650
SPEAKER: Google
Container Registry

00:00:06.650 --> 00:00:08.450
is a private container
image registry

00:00:08.450 --> 00:00:11.220
that runs on Google Cloud
Platform's reliable, fast,

00:00:11.220 --> 00:00:12.830
and secure infrastructure.

00:00:12.830 --> 00:00:14.540
You can access
Container Registry

00:00:14.540 --> 00:00:17.120
through secure HTTPS
end points, which

00:00:17.120 --> 00:00:19.550
allow you to push,
pull, and manage images

00:00:19.550 --> 00:00:23.060
from any system, VM instance,
or your own hardware.

00:00:23.060 --> 00:00:25.430
Additionally, you can use
the Docker Credential Helper

00:00:25.430 --> 00:00:28.850
command line tool to configure
Docker to authenticate directly

00:00:28.850 --> 00:00:30.550
with Container Registry.

00:00:30.550 --> 00:00:32.479
While Docker provides
a central registry

00:00:32.479 --> 00:00:35.420
for storing public images,
you might not want your images

00:00:35.420 --> 00:00:37.070
to be accessible to the world.

00:00:37.070 --> 00:00:38.810
To control access
to your images,

00:00:38.810 --> 00:00:41.330
you must store them
in a private registry.

00:00:41.330 --> 00:00:43.010
This hands-on lab
demonstrates how

00:00:43.010 --> 00:00:45.730
to build a Docker image
containing a basic Python web

00:00:45.730 --> 00:00:48.470
app and push it to Google
Container Registry.

00:00:48.470 --> 00:00:50.150
This lab is also
part of a series

00:00:50.150 --> 00:00:51.842
of labs called Qwik Starts.

00:00:51.842 --> 00:00:53.300
These labs are
designed to give you

00:00:53.300 --> 00:00:55.790
a little taste of the many
features available with Google

00:00:55.790 --> 00:00:56.600
Cloud.

00:00:56.600 --> 00:00:58.640
Search for Qwik Starts
in the lab catalog

00:00:58.640 --> 00:01:00.980
to find the next lab
that you'd like to take.

00:01:00.980 --> 00:01:03.170
Next up on our quest
is Deployment Manager--

00:01:03.170 --> 00:01:05.020
Qwik Start.

